---
// Categories.astro - Training programs & categories
---

<section id="categorias" class="py-20 md:py-32 relative bg-[#071926]/90 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative background effects -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-sky-600/10 rounded-full blur-[140px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="section-header text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 md:mb-20">
      <span class="text-teal-400 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest inline-block mb-3">
        // PROGRAMAS DEPORTIVOS
      </span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black uppercase text-white leading-tight mb-5">
        Una categoría ideal <span class="text-gradient">para cada etapa</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Diseñamos planes de entrenamiento específicos para cada edad y nivel de experiencia. ¡Descubre el programa perfecto para ti o tus hijos!
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Category Cards Grid -->
    <div class="category-grid grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      
      <!-- Card 1: Semillero / Iniciación -->
      <div class="category-card card-glass rounded-3xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between border border-teal-500/20 hover:border-teal-400/50 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-teal-900/30 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div>
          <!-- Image Banner -->
          <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="/images/court-ball.jpg" 
              alt="Semillero e iniciación Domus Voleibol" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a1f2e] via-black/40 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-500 text-[#05131d] font-extrabold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase">
                6 a 12 Años
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Content -->
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors mb-2">
              Semillero & Iniciación
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
              Enfocado en el desarrollo psicomotriz, coordinación, voleo básico, saque y compañerismo en un entorno dinámico y seguro.
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-300 mb-6">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Desarrollo motor y reflejos</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Fundamentos de voleo y recepción</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Juegos aplicados y recreativos</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 pt-0">
          <button 
            data-open-modal 
            data-category="Semillero (6 a 12 años)"
            class="w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 hover:bg-teal-500 border border-teal-500/40 hover:border-teal-400 text-teal-300 hover:text-[#05131d] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer text-center"
          >
            Inscribirme a Semillero
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Menores & Juvenil -->
      <div class="category-card card-glass rounded-3xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between border border-teal-500/20 hover:border-teal-400/50 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-teal-900/30 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div>
          <!-- Image Banner -->
          <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="/images/jump-serve.jpg" 
              alt="Categoría menores y juvenil voleibol" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-t from-[#0a1f2e] via-black/40 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-500 text-[#05131d] font-extrabold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase">
                13 a 17 Años
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Content -->
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors mb-2">
              Menores & Juvenil
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
              Técnica rigurosa, salto de remate, colocación táctica y defensa. Preparación para torneos y ligas competitivas.
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-300 mb-6">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Ataque, bloqueo y salto vertical</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Sistemas de rotación y recepción</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Partidos y topes amistosos</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 pt-0">
          <button 
            data-open-modal 
            data-category="Juvenil (13 a 17 años)"
            class="w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 hover:bg-teal-500 border border-teal-500/40 hover:border-teal-400 text-teal-300 hover:text-[#05131d] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer text-center"
          >
            Inscribirme a Juvenil
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Mayores & Adultos (Mixto) -->
      <div class="category-card card-glass rounded-3xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between border-2 border-teal-400/40 shadow-xl shadow-teal-950/40 hover:border-teal-300 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 group relative">
        <div class="absolute -top-3 right-6 z-20">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-400 to-orange-400 text-slate-900 font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider shadow-md">
            ⭐ Muy Popular
          </span>
        </div>

        <div>
          <!-- Image Banner -->
          <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="/images/libero-defense.jpg" 
              alt="Categoría mayores adultos voleibol" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a1f2e] via-black/40 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-400 text-[#05131d] font-extrabold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase">
                18+ Años / Libre
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Content -->
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors mb-2">
              Mayores & Adultos
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
              Entrena después de tu rutina diaria. Clases dinámicas para aprender desde cero o mejorar tu nivel, con partidos todos los días.
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-300 mb-6">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Acondicionamiento físico completo</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Modalidad Mixta y Femenina</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Partidos dirigidos al final de sesión</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 pt-0">
          <button 
            data-open-modal 
            data-category="Mayores / Adultos (18+ años)"
            class="w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 to-teal-400 hover:from-teal-400 hover:to-teal-300 text-[#05131d] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer text-center shadow-lg shadow-teal-500/25"
          >
            Inscribirme a Mayores
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Competitivo & Alto Rendimiento -->
      <div class="category-card card-glass rounded-3xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between border border-teal-500/20 hover:border-teal-400/50 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-teal-900/30 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div>
          <!-- Image Banner -->
          <div class="relative h-48 overflow-hidden">
            <img 
              src="/images/match-point.jpg" 
              alt="Equipo competitivo Domus Voleibol" 
              class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500"
            />
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#0a1f2e] via-black/40 to-transparent"></div>
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
              <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-500 text-[#05131d] font-extrabold text-xs tracking-wider uppercase">
                Avanzado / Torneos
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Content -->
          <div class="p-6">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-white group-hover:text-teal-400 transition-colors mb-2">
              Equipo Competitivo
            </h3>
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
              Para jugadores con experiencia previa que desean competir en ligas locales, torneos inter-clubes y campeonatos de Lima.
            </p>

            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-300 mb-6">
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Estrategia táctica avanzada (5-1)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Pliometría y potencia muscular</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-teal-400 shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/></svg>
                <span>Representación oficial en torneos</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 pt-0">
          <button 
            data-open-modal 
            data-category="Competitivo / Avanzado"
            class="w-full py-3 px-4 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 hover:bg-teal-500 border border-teal-500/40 hover:border-teal-400 text-teal-300 hover:text-[#05131d] font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-200 cursor-pointer text-center"
          >
            Postular a Competitivo
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
